;val&quot;:11},&quot;numPr&quot;:{},&quot;pStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;ParagraphProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;比赛介绍&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:115,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:115,&quot;len&quot;:4},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;黑体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;黑体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;黑体&quot;},&quot;b&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:true},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:280},&quot;rStyle&quot;:{},&quot;author&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\\r&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:119,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:119,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;b&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:true},&quot;bCs&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:true},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:300},&quot;szCs&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:300},&quot;isPlaceholder&quot;:true,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;rStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyParagraphProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:119,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;spacing&quot;:{&quot;before&quot;:240,&quot;after&quot;:120},&quot;jc&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:2},&quot;ind&quot;:{},&quot;numPr&quot;:{},&quot;pStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;ParagraphProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;本次比赛共有46名参赛选手，共分为预选赛、小组赛、半决赛和决赛四个赛程。预选赛将选手分为23组，采用一局淘汰制决出23名选手进入小组赛；小组赛将选手分为六组，采用组内车轮积分制，每小组第一进入半决赛；半决赛则是一局淘汰制决出3名选手进入决赛；最后就是决赛，通过车轮战，先赢得两局的选手即为一等奖，剩下两名选手则为二等奖。在半决赛中落败的三名选手为三等奖。&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:120,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:120,&quot;len&quot;:177},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;rFonts&quot;:{&quot;ascii&quot;:&quot;宋体&quot;,&quot;hAnsi&quot;:&quot;宋体&quot;,&quot;eastAsia&quot;:&quot;宋体&quot;},&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;rStyle&quot;:{},&quot;author&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\\r&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:297,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:297,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;sz&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:240},&quot;isPlaceholder&quot;:true,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;rStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyParagraphProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:297,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;spacing&quot;:{&quot;after&quot;:120,&quot;line&quot;:360,&quot;lineRule&quot;:1},&quot;ind&quot;:{&quot;firstLine&quot;:480},&quot;jc&quot;:{&quot;val&quot;:11},&quot;numPr&quot;:{},&quot;pStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;ParagraphProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;}],&quot;subStory&quot;:[],&quot;srcGlobalPadId&quot;:&quot;231ce570-e45f-5d69-9871-f176371dd579&quot;,&quot;copyStart&quot;:26}\" data-version=\"3.0.0\" inner_data_type=\"localData\" data-hash=\"937591e2f64ebe7b8172d600eea59ea1\"></div><div><div><p>为丰富校园文化生活，弘扬中华优秀传统文化，锻炼同学们的逻辑思维与大局意识，计算机科学与技术学院于2026年4月11日开展“麒麟才子杯”象棋比赛。本次比赛吸引了众多象棋爱好者踊跃参与，在方寸棋盘间展开了一场场智慧与定力的精彩较量。</p><p>比赛介绍</p><p>本次比赛共有46名参赛选手，共分为预选赛、小组赛、半决赛和决赛四个赛程。预选赛将选手分为23组，采用一局淘汰制决出23名选手进入小组赛；小组赛将选手分为六组，采用组内车轮积分制，每小组第一进入半决赛；半决赛则是一局淘汰制决出3名选手进入决赛；最后就是决赛，通过车轮战，先赢得两局的选手即为一等奖，剩下两名选手则为二等奖。在半决赛中落败的三名选手为三等奖。</p></div></div><div tdoc-data-src=\"{&quot;mainStory&quot;:[{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;InsertText&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;\\b&quot;,&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:0,&quot;len&quot;:0},&quot;preventTextTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyRunProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:0,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;isPlaceholder&quot;:true,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;rStyle&quot;:{}},&quot;mode&quot;:1,&quot;preventFormatTrackChanges&quot;:false},&quot;propertyType&quot;:&quot;RunProperty&quot;,&quot;builtinStyleName&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;operationType&quot;:&quot;ModifyDrawingProp&quot;,&quot;param&quot;:{&quot;range&quot;:{&quot;gcpBegin&quot;:0,&quot;len&quot;:1},&quot;property&quot;:{&quot;inlineKeyword&quot;:{&quot;extent&quot;:{&quot;cx&quot;:526097